2d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/operator_sets.h", "path": "onnx/defs/operator_sets.h", "quote": "These calls for schema registration here are required to be in descending order for this to work correctly", "url": "https://github.com/onnx/onnx/blob/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/operator_sets.h"}, {"artifact_path": "guideline-files/onnx/onnx/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/operator_sets_preview.h", "path": "onnx/defs/operator_sets_preview.h", "quote": "Preview operators should have only one version.", "url": "https://github.com/onnx/onnx/blob/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/operator_sets_preview.h"}, {"artifact_path": "guideline-files/onnx/onnx/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/data_type_utils.cc", "path": "onnx/defs/data_type_utils.cc", "quote": "DataType strings. These should match the DataTypes defined in onnx.proto", "url": "https://github.com/onnx/onnx/blob/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/defs/data_type_utils.cc"}, {"artifact_path": "guideline-files/onnx/onnx/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/common/graph_node_list.h", "path": "onnx/common/graph_node_list.h", "quote": "It must have a field: T* next_in_graph[2] = { nullptr, nullptr };", "url": "https://github.com/onnx/onnx/blob/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/common/graph_node_list.h"}, {"artifact_path": "guideline-files/onnx/onnx/57bb876250ecc07623a744512d94b44221fb3ed8/onnx/common/ir.h", "path": "onnx/common/ir.h", "quote": "All transformations to graphs must preserve
